    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "`#pypy on irc.libera.chat`_",
      "source_hash": 15483240630145351873,
      "context_hash": 7408918063814374199,
      "translation": "`#pypy on irc.libera.chat`_",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T06:23:41.868501Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Many of the core developers are hanging out here.",
      "source_hash": 14593383632791444965,
      "context_hash": 6189374927916708402,
      "translation": "이곳에는 많은 핵심 개발자들이 모여 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T06:23:52.527030Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "You are welcome to join and ask questions (if they are not already answered in the :doc:`FAQ <faq>`).",
      "source_hash": 8437633440489806126,
      "context_hash": 9704724224736945979,
      "translation": "자유롭게 참여하여 질문하셔도 됩니다(:doc:`FAQ <faq>`\\ 에 이미 답변이 나와 있지 않은 경우).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T06:23:52.527031Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "You can find logs of the channel here_.",
      "source_hash": 3452839446965905812,
      "context_hash": 3705271047124271171,
      "translation": "채널 로그는 here_\\ 에서 확인할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T06:23:52.527031Z",
      "issues": [
        "The meaning is accurate, and `here_\\ ` correctly keeps the reStructuredText link working, but the page will show \"채널 로그는 here에서 확인할 수 있습니다.\" The English word \"here\" inside a Korean sentence reads awkwardly, so a Korean label like `` `여기 <URL>`_ `` would read more naturally."
      ]
    },
