    {
      "id": "section:5/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "Meeting PyPy developers",
      "source_hash": 10482689790505826659,
      "context_hash": 2340986071841086032,
      "translation": "PyPy 개발자와의 만남",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "PyPy": "PyPy"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T06:23:52.533474Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "The PyPy developers are organizing sprints and presenting results at conferences all year round.",
      "source_hash": 1350419154925176448,
      "context_hash": 16706546978158804717,
      "translation": "PyPy 개발자들은 일 년 내내 스프린트를 열고 콘퍼런스에서 성과를 발표하고 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "PyPy": "PyPy"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T06:23:52.534274Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:10/seg:1",
      "source": "They will be happy to meet in person with anyone interested in the project.",
      "source_hash": 2615370519774721039,
      "context_hash": 6527327526325002531,
      "translation": "개발자들은 이 프로젝트에 관심 있는 분이라면 누구든 기꺼이 직접 만나고자 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T06:23:52.534274Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:10/seg:2",
      "source": "Watch out for sprint announcements on the `development mailing list`_.",
      "source_hash": 8468430708472387825,
      "context_hash": 4589778325176179968,
      "translation": "`development mailing list`_\\ 에 올라오는 스프린트 공지를 주시하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T06:23:52.534274Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "Twitter handle `#pypyproject`_",
      "source_hash": 1778675943374742551,
      "context_hash": 2585550371824986303,
      "translation": "트위터 핸들 `#pypyproject`_",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T03:22:37.610651Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "Watch us on twitch_",
      "source_hash": 7469581994381507156,
      "context_hash": 16414342001771395261,
      "translation": "twitch_\\ 에서 저희 방송을 시청하십시오",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T06:23:52.535360Z",
      "issues": [
        "The meaning is correct, and `twitch_\\ ` is valid reStructuredText escaping that renders as \"twitch에서\". However, the formal command \"시청하십시오\" sounds stiff for a casual invitation; \"Twitch에서 저희 방송을 시청하세요\" would read more naturally."
      ]
    },
